# Component standards

Extract reusable components. Prefer composition over one-off JSX.

## Design-system shared components

Typography (`Display`, `Headline`, `Title`, `Stat`, `Label`, `Overline`,
`Caption`, `Body`, `BodySm`)
SectionHeader · StatusChip · MetricRail · UserAvatar · BrandMark · TeamLogoBadge
FormField · Checkbox · SegmentedControl
EmptyState / LoadingState / ErrorState  
BottomSheet · toast helpers

## Feature UI patterns (reuse these)

- `MatchTicket` — Home next-match surface (`features/dashboard`)
- `MatchPollControl` — compact/full availability + carpool voting
- `ManageMatchSheet` — staged Admin match lifecycle
- `PaymentProofFields` — common UTR + screenshot proof fields
- `WeekendDaySection` + `CreateTournamentSheet` — weekend create flow
- Auth: `AuthShell`, `LoginForm`, `OtpForm`
- Team: `TeamMembersView`, `AddPlayerForm` (sheet)

## Rules

- Primitives live in `components/ui` (shadcn).
- Compose higher-level UI in `common` / `forms` / `dialogs` / `feedback`.
- Display/stat copy must use `font-heading` (Oswald).
- Use one `h1` per route; use shared typography roles instead of ad-hoc text sizes.
- Operational copy is at least 12px.
- Selected states on segmented controls use amber accent — do not invent parallel toggles.
- Avoid nesting cards inside cards; prefer tonal surfaces and hairline dividers.
- Keep feature files under ~250 lines; extract day sections / sheets / tickets.

Reuse before creating new components.
